# Security lane

Before modifying security/, read security/AGENTS.md and
security/rules_of_engagement.md.

- Keep defensive intent, authorization boundaries, auditability, and
  fail-loud evidence intact.
- Do not convert a defensive analysis surface into uncontrolled external action.
- Never print, commit, or transmit credentials, tokens, or private keys.
- Use the PAN Python production lane for source changes, including direct
  provenance and real verification.
